---
description: Keep Cursor edits isolated to its assigned Git worktree
alwaysApply: true
---

- This Cursor checkout is the dedicated `cursor/agentic-compliance` worktree.
- Keep edits, commits, and pushes on this worktree's branch. Do not edit Codex's
  or Claude Code's worktrees, and do not edit `main` directly.
- The Cursor app and Cursor CLI share files when opened in this same folder. Do
  not run two Cursor agent sessions that write to this worktree simultaneously.
- After completing a requested task, review and commit/push only that task's
  finished changes. Leave unrelated or in-progress changes alone.
